= zero or many&lt;br&gt;• 'stock' links a product to a location, so one product can be stored in several locations.&lt;br&gt;• Dashed table is optional: add only if the final target is food (batch/expiry/FEFO).&lt;br&gt;• [UQ] on 'stock' = UNIQUE(product_id, location_id) as a pair: one row per product per location.&lt;br&gt;• stock_transactions.quantity is signed: IN/OUT = amount moved; ADJUST = counted − recorded (+/−).&lt;br&gt;• Scanned code is looked up in products.barcode; products without a barcode get a generated QR code stored in barcode." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="520" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="DFD - Context Diagram" id="pg140209125197200"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="ctitle" value="Figure 3.X: Context Diagram of the AI-Assisted Inventory System" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sys" value="&lt;b&gt;0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI-Assisted Inventory System" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="120" width="360" height="1000" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="staff" value="Staff" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="170" height="1000" as="geometry"/></m